Revision: 5.0.4
Title: DASH-IF IOP v5 Part 7: Video
Status: LD
Repository: Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5
Shortname: iop-v5-part7
URL: https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part07-video.html
Group: dashif
Editor: Stephan Schreiner, Dolby, https://www.linkedin.com/in/stephanschreiner/
Abstract: Video interoperability points, CMAF media profiles, codec signalling, DASH MPD parameters, and video-specific constraints. Working draft authored in the IOPv5 workspace.

!Issue Tracking: <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues?q=is%3Aopen+project%3ADash-Industry-Forum%2F33" target="_blank">Currently open Part 7 issues</a><br><a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues/new?title=%5BPart+7%5D%3A+" target="_blank">File a new Part 7 issue</a> (then assign to <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Dash-Industry-Forum/projects/33" target="_blank">Part 7 project</a>)
!Document Status: <strong>Working Draft 0.3</strong>.<br><small>See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part07-video.html#document-status">Annex A: Document Status</a> for versioning and workflow.</small>
!Contributors: Contributors are maintained via GitHub pull requests to the <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5">IOPv5 repository</a>.
!Contributing: See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#contributing">Part 1 §1.4 Contributing and Reviewing</a>.
!Key Words: Video, CMAF, Codecs, HDR, MPD Signalling
</pre>

